# ACL for IoT Telemetry Platform
# Each ESP32 can only access topics for its own motor_id
# Backend has broad read/write across all motors
# QA injector can only write to qa/ topics

# --- ESP32 devices (one per motor) ---

user esp32_motor1
topic write plant/motor/1/telemetry
topic write plant/motor/1/status
topic write plant/motor/1/restart-progress
topic read plant/motor/1/cmd
topic read plant/motor/1/sensor/+/cmd
topic write plant/motor/1/cmd/ack
topic write plant/motor/1/sensor/+/cmd/ack
topic read qa/motor/1/inject-fault

